    "title": "Human Owner Knowledge metadata and tree reads",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Independent adapter; production root is not installed. Current Human Session/Project Owner reauthorized for every request. GET/HEAD only; no content, object IDs, downloads or D13. Original 2s request budget and 5 MiB complete response; strict duplicate/unknown/query parsing in Go. Root children requires explicit parent_document_id=null. Search is literal title substring, not full-text retrieval. Safe scalar/relationship/current authorization invariants remain enforced in Go."
  },
